{"3724100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Luminas: Parasite Reign", "steam_appid": 3724100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminas: Parasite Reign, a party-based rogue-lite where magic meets chaos and party strategy defines survival. Control up to three unique Luminas, magical beings fighting back against the monstrous Parasites corrupting the world of Solaris Land. With waves of enemies, epic boss battles, and evolving abilities, every run is a fight for survival and a chance to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 Luminas</strong>, each with unique spells and playstyles<strong> </strong>and create your <strong>party</strong>. <strong>Glass Cannon</strong> builds, <strong>Heal</strong> builds, <strong>Tank</strong> builds, <strong>Death</strong>/<strong>Revive</strong> builds as well as classic 'dps-tank-support' builds, <strong>Combo abilities</strong> and more. Find your favorite playstyle and defeat your enemies!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses and Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different <strong>bosses</strong>, across unique <strong>biome</strong> maps with extra mechanics. Over twenty <strong>parasites</strong> trying to devour you. They might be strong, but this is your world and you are stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve and Combine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminas can <strong>evolve</strong> during your runs, gaining extra abilities and stats. Decide on what to evolve based on your current party and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for evolving, certain Lumina pairs can combine their abilities to create <strong>combos</strong>! Find the secret pairs and unlock <strong>new abilities</strong> during your runs!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Lumina has its own <strong>Skilltree</strong>, with different paths that open new builds<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the various maps, you can also buy and unlock <strong>treasures</strong> from your village vendor to further enhance your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupt</strong> your runs and discover new ways to play the game. As corruption rises, gameplay rules change! Expanded rosters, new camera perspectives, as well as stronger and more enemies await. Try to reach maximum corruption and push your skills to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We’re Building This With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access launches</strong> with <strong>3 dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>8 playable Luminas</strong>, and over <strong>90 treasures</strong> to discover and combine. Each Lumina comes with <strong>3 distinct skill paths</strong>, allowing endless experimentation and progression as you build your perfect team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive, unlock treasures, experiment with parties, and face unique Parasites and bosses as you push your mastery further with every run. <strong>Luminas: Parasite Reign</strong> is crafted by a small indie team obsessed with fantasy worlds, RPG elements, party-based roguelites, and deep replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback during Early Access will help shape new <strong>modes, Luminas, spells, maps, and bosses</strong> as Solaris Land continues to evolve. Are you ready to awaken the power within and stand against the Parasite tide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=189 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Solaris Land. Build your party. Survive the storm.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/63cec1039e4d7aba1730c85c0ab245f1.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Luminas: Parasite Reign, a party-based rogue-lite where magic meets chaos and party strategy defines survival. Control up to three unique Luminas, magical beings fighting back against the monstrous Parasites corrupting the world of Solaris Land. With waves of enemies, epic boss battles, and evolving abilities, every run is a fight for survival and a chance to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 Luminas</strong>, each with unique spells and playstyles<strong> </strong>and create your <strong>party</strong>. <strong>Glass Cannon</strong> builds, <strong>Heal</strong> builds, <strong>Tank</strong> builds, <strong>Death</strong>/<strong>Revive</strong> builds as well as classic 'dps-tank-support' builds, <strong>Combo abilities</strong> and more. Find your favorite playstyle and defeat your enemies!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/70fcd13f9a98eb73d3abaf60a53dce47.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses and Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different <strong>bosses</strong>, across unique <strong>biome</strong> maps with extra mechanics. Over twenty <strong>parasites</strong> trying to devour you. They might be strong, but this is your world and you are stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/1dad1e1470937614544e1839d4016886.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve and Combine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminas can <strong>evolve</strong> during your runs, gaining extra abilities and stats. Decide on what to evolve based on your current party and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for evolving, certain Lumina pairs can combine their abilities to create <strong>combos</strong>! Find the secret pairs and unlock <strong>new abilities</strong> during your runs!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/2ba58a6a7ad79e51b126b1358c454a09.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Lumina has its own <strong>Skilltree</strong>, with different paths that open new builds<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the various maps, you can also buy and unlock <strong>treasures</strong> from your village vendor to further enhance your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupt</strong> your runs and discover new ways to play the game. As corruption rises, gameplay rules change! Expanded rosters, new camera perspectives, as well as stronger and more enemies await. Try to reach maximum corruption and push your skills to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/bb6a3b1444061ba8c15e6ba8c3acdc92.mp4?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We’re Building This With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access launches</strong> with <strong>3 dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>8 playable Luminas</strong>, and over <strong>90 treasures</strong> to discover and combine. Each Lumina comes with <strong>3 distinct skill paths</strong>, allowing endless experimentation and progression as you build your perfect team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive, unlock treasures, experiment with parties, and face unique Parasites and bosses as you push your mastery further with every run. <strong>Luminas: Parasite Reign</strong> is crafted by a small indie team obsessed with fantasy worlds, RPG elements, party-based roguelites, and deep replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback during Early Access will help shape new <strong>modes, Luminas, spells, maps, and bosses</strong> as Solaris Land continues to evolve. Are you ready to awaken the power within and stand against the Parasite tide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.poster.avif?t=1785837960\" width=189 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/extras/56541be169f69e4584a0b58517027686.webm?t=1785837960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Solaris Land. Build your party. Survive the storm.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A single-player, party-based survivor roguelite where you control up to 3 heroes at once. Fight massive enemy waves, defeat unique bosses, unlock powerful treasures, and build synergies through multiple skill paths. Every run brings new upgrades, combos, and strategic choices to survive longer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/840ef411ecd334b406518567bd5eb47bfdb9e0cb/header.jpg?t=1785837960", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/b8524fcc474c1de5b10ba3cd4039b53d0b1ddbba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785837960", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724100/b8524fcc474c1de5b10ba3cd4039b53d0b1ddbba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785837960", "websit